MAGNETICS CONSTRUCTION
Text Notes 20860 28970 0    60   ~ 0
identity per docs/magnetics.md (turns, gap, litz, acceptance lines live there)
Text Notes 20850 29400 0    60   ~ 0
D3 T1-T3: 2x E70/33/32 sets (B66372B2000 former), 6:6:6, Bpk 90mT, pri litz 3486x0.071 + sec foil 0.127x28 (E60), Lm 63uH +/-7% gap-ground
Text Notes 20850 29700 0    60   ~ 0
D2 L1T-L3T: 1x E70/33/32, N=5, bins 3.2/3.5/3.8uH, litz 4150x0.071 (16.4mm2, E60 proximity rev)
Text Notes 20850 30000 0    60   ~ 0
total Lr = trim + measured xfmr leakage (bins COMPENSATE leakage spread); Cr at TANK sections
